ssification on RGB images. We will Look at the levels of RGB images in Particular  Centroidal Pixels and We can Classify from the Centre Which Shape is Defined. We are Planing to  Use RESNET - Residual Neural Networks or Similar to be able to argue and analyze the better  Accuracy between all of the Networks. ","topics":[],"score":224451,"global_rank":150383},{"name":"Chinmay4285/BankCustomerchurnprediction","owner":"Chinmay4285","html_url":"https://github.com/Chinmay4285/BankCustomerchurnprediction","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"It is a detailed machine learning project that covers various topics like EDA, Feature engineering,Model building and Hyper parameter tuning.","topics":[],"score":224451,"global_rank":150392},{"name":"daresnick/Data-Mining-Group-Project","owner":"daresnick","html_url":"https://github.com/daresnick/Data-Mining-Group-Project","stars":0,"forks":3,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":224450,"global_rank":150397},{"name":"caruso1058/Automate-the-Boring-Stuff","owner":"caruso1058","html_url":"https://github.com/caruso1058/Automate-the-Boring-Stuff","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Exercises in Automate the Boring Stuff","topics":[],"score":224449,"global_rank":150400},{"name":"ohughes16/Movies-ETL","owner":"ohughes16","html_url":"https://github.com/ohughes16/Movies-ETL","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":224449,"global_rank":150415},{"name":"The-Shy7/math-381-predicting-miscarriage","owner":"The-Shy7","html_url":"https://github.com/The-Shy7/math-381-predicting-miscarriage","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"The code for my data project on predicting miscarriage. This was completed as my final project for the class Math 381, \"Discrete Mathematical M